{"id":"16a0986548e446d8","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-quantum-fourier-transform.md","title":"Quantum Fourier Transform on a Cyclic Register","display":"df-quantum-fourier-transform — Quantum Fourier Transform on a Cyclic Register","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-quantum-fourier-transform","aliases":["28-df-quantum-fourier-transform"],"display":"df-quantum-fourier-transform — Quantum Fourier Transform on a Cyclic Register","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.6.2, Lemma 10.17","source_printed_pages":"223–224","source_pdf_pages":"249–250","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-quantum-fourier-transform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-quantum-fourier-transform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-fourier-transform — Quantum Fourier Transform on a Cyclic Register"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.6.2, Lemma 10.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"223–224"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"249–250"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(M\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z_M=\\{0,\\ldots,M-1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb Z_M=\\{0,\\ldots,M-1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_M=e^{2\\pi i/M}\">\\(\\omega_M=e^{2\\pi i/M}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_M=\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z_M}\">\\(\\mathcal K_M=\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z_M}\\)</span>，内积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\overline{u_x}v_x\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\overline{u_x}v_x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle=(\\mathbf1[y=x])_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\">\\(|x\\rangle=(\\mathbf1[y=x])_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\)</span> 是其标准基。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_M\">\\(F_M\\)</span> 为由下式基作用唯一线性延拓的算子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}v_y|y\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_M\">\\(v=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}v_y|y\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb Z_M\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb Z_M\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_M\">\\(\\mathcal K_M\\)</span> 上的恒等算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\">\\(\\dagger\\)</span> 表示相对于上述内积的伴随；矩阵元素按该计算基编号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_M|y\\rangle\\coloneqq M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\omega_M^{xy}|x\\rangle,\\qquad (F_Mv)_x=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\omega_M^{xy}v_y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_M|y\\rangle\\coloneqq M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\omega_M^{xy}|x\\rangle,\\qquad (F_Mv)_x=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\omega_M^{xy}v_y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_M^\\dagger F_M=I,\\qquad (F_M^{-1})_{x,y}=M^{-1/2}\\omega_M^{-xy}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_M^\\dagger F_M=I,\\qquad (F_M^{-1})_{x,y}=M^{-1/2}\\omega_M^{-xy}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>几何级数给不同列内积零、相同列内积一，因此逆为共轭转置。M=1亦成立。原书量子高效实现另要求M为2的幂；本定义的幺正恒等式适用于任意M，不混同一般M的实现复杂度。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.6.2, Lemma 10.17；印刷页 223–224；PDF 页 249–250。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Quantum Fourier Transform on a Cyclic Register，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z_M=\\{0,\\ldots,M-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_M=e^{2\\pi i/M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_M=\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z_M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\overline{u_x}v_x","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle=(\\mathbf1[y=x])_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}","display":false},{"tex":"F_M","display":false},{"tex":"v=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}v_y|y\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_M","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb Z_M","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"F_M|y\\rangle\\coloneqq M^{-1/2}\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\omega_M^{xy}|x\\rangle,\\qquad (F_Mv)_x=M^{-1/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\mathbb Z_M}\\omega_M^{xy}v_y.","display":true},{"tex":"F_M^\\dagger F_M=I,\\qquad (F_M^{-1})_{x,y}=M^{-1/2}\\omega_M^{-xy}.","display":true}],"bytes":2064,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}